        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "9-5-3 School library information specialists shall report for work three (3) days before the reporting date for classroom teachers, unless the library information specialist and the principal or immediate supervisor mutually agree to a different sched-ule for the six (6) additional days. (Library information specialists shall receive additional pay at the rate of one one hundred eighty-seventh [1/187th] of their annual salaries for each additional day worked.)",
            "block_bbox": [
