            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "9-5-4 Full-time counselors shall work ten (10) additional days per year, and part-time counselors shall work five (5) additional days per year. (Counselors shall receive additional pay at the rate of one one hundred eighty-seventh [1/187th] of their annual salaries for each additional day worked.)",
